      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}\n\n[Translate with Gemini]\n\nThank you for your fast reply!\n\n> Does this happens every avatar you upload?\n\nYes, any of them could fail, but it happens inconsistently.\n\n> Do you know a particular sequence of non-ASCII characters that reproduces the issue you describe?\n\nThere is no particular characters to reproduce it; it should be anything such as あ, ア, 亜, â, æ.\n\nAdditionally, I should let you know that the error message when failes to build is \"Illegal byte sequence encounted in the input.\"\n\n[Original]\n\n> Does this happens every avatar you upload?\n\nはい。すべてのアバターで発生する可能性があります。(し、発生しました)\n\n面倒なことに、発生はランダムです。\n\n> Do you know a particular sequence of non-ASCII characters that reproduces the issue you describe?\n\nこれは特定のバイトシーケンスに限らず、非アスキー文字全般で発生しうるもののようです。(例: あ, ア, 亜, â, æ)\n\n補足として、アップロードが失敗する際には決まって「Illegal byte sequence encounted in the input.」が発生します。",
